xcuserdata
Distribution/raw assets/*
buildServer.json

# Skip / Android
.build/
.idea/
Android/.gradle/
Android/.kotlin/
Android/app/build/
Android/gradle/gradle-daemon-jvm.properties
DerivedData/
Package.resolved
# ...except the root one. Three deps resolve from mutable `branch: "android"`
# refs, so without the committed revisions a build silently takes whatever those
# branches point at and a release APK isn't reproducible. The bare pattern above
# still covers FAKit/Package.resolved and the Xcode workspace's copy.
!/Package.resolved
# Derived art, regenerated by Scripts/generate-android-assets.sh from the iOS catalog.
FurAffinityUI/Resources/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.imageset/
Android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher.png
Android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher_foreground.png
local.properties
*.moved-aside
# `skip export -d out` artifacts
out/
# Release signing. Losing keystore.jks permanently ends the upgrade path for
# every installed user, so keep an off-machine backup — it is not in git.
Android/app/keystore.jks
Android/app/keystore.properties
